WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.285
{\an8}[juruhebah]
<i>Pemenang</i>I Am Boxer <i>akan menerima</i>

2
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:19.920
{\an8}<i>hadiah utama 300 juta won</i>

3
00:00:19.987 --> 00:00:23.190
{\an8}<i>dan SUV perdana teratas.</i>

4
00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.533
[menghembus nafas]

5
00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.639
Hai, saya Don Lee,
