980
00:46:52.643 --> 00:46:54.979
- [peserta 3] Dia perlu masuk! masuk!
- [peserta 4] Pergi!

981
00:46:55.046 --> 00:46:56.047
Tembak, terlalu pendek.

982
00:46:56.113 --> 00:46:57.381
[peserta 5] Lelaki, capaian itu!

983
